# R77 (Muse R77): tabs and spaces mixed in indentation. The header is indented with four spaces,
# the body with tabs. A tab used to count as one column - less than four spaces - so the body was
# read as one statement and the second line ran unconditionally: v274 printed 10, not 0.
# v275 refuses it at the line: E_ANTARAL_MISHRA. (Indent with tabs everywhere or spaces everywhere.)
mukhya()
    vitti c = 0
    yadi (1 == 2)
	c = c + 1
	c = c + 10
    likha(c)
